Experimental RPC retirement for the startup-only observation profile. Context Foundry does not apply this patch automatically.
Upstream base: can1357/oh-my-pi@24439066040e006eb08da7b204f0ac41c79d2de9 (MIT).
Apply after the previously qualified startup series through omp-startup-workspace-scan-exclusion.patch.
Owners: CLI runRootCommand and runRpcMode, with the original RpcOutputWriter shutdown barrier and a one-use source receipt.
Native controls cover original catalog and output completion, ordinary subscription, unexpected input, invalid flags, missing observer, and receipt identity.
The profile excludes RPC dispatch and native Ready. It provides no startup admission, provider authority, or signing.
